er } 1,\\]\n\\[13 \\div 6 = 2 \\text{ remainder } 1,\\]\n\\[2 \\div 6 = 0 \\text{ remainder } 2.\\]\n\nReading the remainders from bottom to top, we get \\(476_{10} = 2112_6\\).\n\nTherefore, the product of \\(315_6 \\cdot 4_6\\) in base 6 is \\(\\boxed{2112_6}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{2112_6}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"number_theory:54"}
